<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="nl">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Tuinplantplanner</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #4a6b4a;
            --secondary: #f8f9fa;
            --accent: #7cb342;
            --border: #dee2e6;
            --text: #212529;
            --light-text: #6c757d;
        }
        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; }
        body { background-color: #f5f7f5; color: var(--text); line-height: 1.6; padding: 10px; }
        .container { max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; }
        h1 { color: var(--primary); text-align: center; margin-bottom: 15px; font-size: 1.5rem; }
        h2 { color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 1.2rem; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--accent); padding-bottom: 5px; }
        h3 { color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1rem; }
        h4 { color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 6px; font-size: 0.9rem; }
        .section { background: white; border-radius: 6px; box-shadow: 0 1px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); padding: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
        .shortlist-section { background: #fff9f0; border-left: 3px solid var(--accent); }
        .border-section { background: #f0fff0; border-left: 3px solid var(--primary); }
        .filter-controls { display: flex; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
        .filter-controls input, .filter-controls select { padding: 6px 8px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 4px; font-size: 13px; flex: 1; min-width: 140px; }
        .filter-controls input[type="text"] { flex: 2; }
        .plant-list { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
        .plant-card { border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 4px; padding: 10px; background: white; }
        .plant-card.selected { border-color: var(--accent); background-color: #f0ffe0; }
        .plant-card input[type="checkbox"] { margin-right: 8px; }
        .genus-group { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 8px; grid-column: 1 / -1; }
        .genus-header { grid-column: 1 / -1; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; padding: 4px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--accent); }
        .genus-header strong { color: var(--primary); font-size: 0.95rem; }
        .genus-header .genus-count { font-size: 12px; color: var(--light-text); }
        .genus-btn { background: var(--secondary); color: var(--primary); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 3px; padding: 2px 8px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 11px; margin-left: auto; }
        .plant-name { font-weight: bold; color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 3px; font-size: 0.9rem; }
        .plant-details { font-size: 12px; color: var(--light-text); margin-top: 5px; }
        .plant-details span { margin-right: 8px; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 3px; }
        .color-indicator { display: inline-block; width: 14px; height: 14px; border-radius: 3px; margin-right: 4px; border: 1px solid #ccc; vertical-align: middle; }
        .shortlist-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 6px; }
        .shortlist-item { background: white; padding: 8px; border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid var(--border); display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
        .shortlist-item button { background: #ff6b6b; color: white; border: none; border-radius: 3px; padding: 2px 6px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 11px; }
        .border-list { margin-bottom: 12px; }
        .border-item { background: white; padding: 8px 10px; border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid var(--border); margin-bottom: 6px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; cursor: pointer; }
        .border-item.active { background: #e8f5e8; border-color: var(--accent); }
        .border-item button { background: var(--primary); color: white; border: none; border-radius: 3px; padding: 3px 6px; cursor: pointer; margin-left: 6px; font-size: 11px; }
        .border-plant-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 8px; font-size: 12px; }
        .border-plant-table th, .border-plant-table td { padding: 6px; text-align: left; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
        .border-plant-table th { background: var(--primary); color: white; font-weight: bold; }
        .add-border-btn { background: var(--accent); color: white; border: none; border-radius: 4px; padding: 8px 12px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 10px; width: 100%; }
        .add-plant-section { margin-top: 12px; padding: 10px; background: #e8f5e8; border-radius: 4px; }
        .add-plant-section select { padding: 6px; border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid var(--border); margin-right: 6px; min-width: 160px; font-size: 13px; }
        .add-plant-section button { background: var(--primary); color: white; border: none; border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer; padding: 6px 10px; font-size: 13px; }
        .hidden { display: none; }
        .btn { padding: 6px 10px; border: none; border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 12px; margin-right: 4px; }
        .btn-primary { background: var(--primary); color: white; }
        .btn-secondary { background: var(--secondary); color: var(--text); border: 1px solid var(--border); }
        .btn-danger { background: #ff6b6b; color: white; }
        .tabs { display: flex; gap: 6px; margin-bottom: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
        .tabs button { flex: 1; min-width: 110px; padding: 10px 12px; border: 1px solid var(--border); background: white; color: var(--text); border-radius: 6px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; }
        .tabs button.active { background: var(--primary); color: white; border-color: var(--primary); }
        .tab-pane { display: none; }
        .tab-pane.active { display: block; }
        .tabs button.settings-tab { flex: 0 0 auto; min-width: 46px; margin-left: auto; font-size: 17px; padding: 10px 12px; }
        .settings-note { font-size: 13px; color: var(--light-text); margin-bottom: 10px; max-width: 640px; }
        .backup-actions { display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 10px 0; }
        @media (min-width: 768px) {
            .plant-list { grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr)); }
            .genus-group { grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr)); }
            .filter-controls { flex-wrap: nowrap; }
            .filter-controls input, .filter-controls select { min-width: 180px; }
            .shortlist-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(220px, 1fr)); }
        }
    </style>

<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.css">
<style>
.gate-section { background: #fff9f0; border-left: 3px solid var(--accent); text-align: center; padding: 24px 12px; }
.gate-section p { color: var(--light-text); margin-bottom: 12px; }
.gate-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; justify-content: center; }
.gate-row input { padding: 10px; border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid var(--border); flex: 1; min-width: 220px; max-width: 420px; font-size: 15px; }
.gate-row button { background: var(--primary); color: white; border: none; border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer; padding: 10px 18px; font-size: 15px; }
.address-title { text-align: center; color: var(--light-text); font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 12px; }
body:not(.has-address) .section { display: none; }
body:not(.has-address) .address-title { display: none; }
body:not(.has-address) #mainTabs { display: none; }
body:not(.has-address) #backupDock { display: none; }
body.has-address #addressGate { display: none; }
.map-section { background: #f0f8ff; border-left: 3px solid #4682b4; }
.map-controls { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; margin-bottom: 10px; align-items: center; }
.map-controls select { padding: 6px; border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid var(--border); min-width: 160px; }
#gardenMap { height: 420px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid var(--border); }
.map-help { font-size: 12px; color: #666; margin-top: 6px; }
.leaflet-container { font: inherit; }
</style>
<script src="https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.js" defer></script>
<script src="map.js" defer></script>
<script src="photos.js" defer></script>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>Tuinplantplanner</h1>
        <div id="addressGate" class="gate-section">
            <h2>Welkom! &#127807;</h2>
            <p>Voer het adres van je tuin in om te beginnen. Daarna kun je planten kiezen en je border op de kaart plannen.</p>
            <div class="gate-row">
                <input type="text" id="gateAddressInput" placeholder="Bijv. Dorpsstraat 1, Utrecht">
                <button id="gateAddressBtn">Naar mijn tuin &rarr;</button>
            </div>
        </div>
        <p id="addressTitle" class="address-title"></p>
<div class="section map-section">
  <h2>Tuin &amp; borders op de kaart &#128506;</h2>
  <div class="map-controls">
    <button class="btn btn-primary" id="mapDrawBtn">Border intekenen</button>
    <button class="btn btn-primary" id="mapFinishDrawBtn" style="display:none;">Klaar &#10003;</button>
    <button class="btn btn-secondary" id="mapLocateBtn">&#128205; Mijn locatie</button>
    <button class="btn btn-secondary" id="changeAddressBtn">&#9998; Adres wijzigen</button>
    <label style="font-size:13px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:4px;"><input type="checkbox" id="mapKadasterToggle" checked> Kadastrale kaart</label>
  </div>
  <div id="gardenMap"></div>
  <p class="map-help">Teken een border door op de kaart te klikken (hoekpunten); dubbelklik of &quot;Klaar&quot; sluit af. De border wordt daarna automatisch aangemaakt en je kunt hem vullen met planten. Klik op een getekende border om deze te bewerken. Kadastrale percellen verschijnen vanaf zoom 14.</p>
</div>
<nav id="mainTabs" class="tabs">
    <button data-tab="planten">&#127793; Planten</button>
    <button data-tab="borders">&#127807; Borders</button>
    <button data-tab="shortlist">&#128203; Shortlist</button>
    <button data-tab="ontwerp">&#127795; Tuinontwerp</button>
    <button data-tab="instellingen" class="settings-tab" title="Instellingen">&#9881;</button>
</nav>
        <div class="section tab-pane" id="tab-planten" data-tabpane="planten">
            <h2>Plantenlijst</h2>
            <div id="plantPickerContainer"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="section shortlist-section tab-pane" id="tab-shortlist" data-tabpane="shortlist">
            <h2>Shortlist (<span id="shortlistCount">0</span> planten)</h2>
            <div class="shortlist-grid" id="shortlist"></div>
            <button class="btn btn-danger" id="clearShortlistBtn">Shortlist leegmaken</button>
        </div>
        <div class="section border-section tab-pane" id="tab-borders" data-tabpane="borders">
            <h2>Border Planner</h2>
            <button class="add-border-btn" id="addBorderBtn">Nieuwe border aanmaken</button>
            <div class="border-list" id="borderList"></div>
            <div id="activeBorderSection" class="hidden">
                <h3 id="activeBorderName"></h3>
                <div class="add-plant-section">
                    <h4>Plant toevoegen:</h4>
                    <select id="addPlantSelect"><option value="">Selecteer een plant...</option></select>
                    <button class="btn btn-primary" id="addPlantToBorderBtn">Toevoegen</button>
                </div>
                <h4>Plantoverzicht:</h4>
                <div style="overflow-x: auto;">
                    <table class="border-plant-table">
                        <thead><tr><th>Plant</th><th>Kleur</th><th>Bloei van</th><th>Bloei tot</th><th>Hoogte van</th><th>Hoogte tot</th><th>Standplaats</th><th>Actie</th></tr></thead>
                        <tbody id="borderPlantTableBody"></tbody>
                    </table>
                </div>
                <div style="margin-top: 8px;">
                    <button class="btn btn-secondary" id="closeBorderBtn">Sluiten</button>
                    <button class="btn btn-danger" id="clearBorderBtn">Border leegmaken</button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="section tab-pane" id="tab-ontwerp" data-tabpane="ontwerp">
            <h2>Tuinontwerp</h2>
            <p class="settings-note">Tuinobjecten uit je ontwerp (paden, terras, gazon, vijver, hagen, ...) staan hier op een rij. Ze worden op de kaart getoond met de &#128208; Ontwerp-toggle rechtsboven in de kaart. Nieuwe objecten importeer je via Instellingen (&#9881;) &rarr; Importeer JSON, borders teken je op de kaart.</p>
            <div id="gardenObjectList"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="section tab-pane" id="tab-instellingen" data-tabpane="instellingen">
            <h2>Instellingen</h2>
            <div id="backupDock"></div>
        </div>

    </div>
